{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u8aac\u660e\u6587\u5185\u306e\u30ad\u30fc\u30d3\u30b8\u30e5\u30a2\u30eb.png?t=1747560472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this world,salt is monopolized,peaceful\u2212thoughts  are mandatory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boy who had a war-thoughts and was about to die was able to get a job collecting garbage in a garden and survived. One day, he meets a fairy in the garden and ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015\u2015</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a roguelike 3D parkour action where you run through randomly generated 3D fields and collect as much trash as you can in time. The more trash you collect and the more thrilling &amp; stylish you look, the more \u201csalt\u201d you earn. The salt you gain can be used to strengthen your body or ingested to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6Turn fall damage into power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a random field with height differences, you will repeatedly climb to high places and jump down to low footholds. In this game, falling damage is present, but it can be nullified by activating \u201cAnti-Impact\u201d by pressing the button at the right moment at the moment of landing and kicking off surrounding enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tension you feel when you jump down from a high place while dodging enemy attacks and the sense of accomplishment you get when you land on your feet is intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u30a2\u30f3\u30c1\u30a4\u30f3\u30d1\u30af\u30c8\u30b4\u30df\u62fe\u3044.gif?t=1747560472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6Randomly generated fields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The field changes every time the game starts. This tests the player's ability to improvise. As the game progresses, more vicious and challenging fields will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u30e9\u30f3\u30c0\u30e0\u751f\u6210\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u8aac\u660e\u7528.gif?t=1747560472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6Dystopian world shrouded in mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a dystopia created by a mysterious organization that exclusively controls \u201csalt,\u201d thoughts are continually measured by a thought tag embedded in your mind.\u00a0You do not get salt because you are not a \u201cpeaceful thinker.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/\u8b0e\u306b\u5305\u307e\u308c\u305f\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30c8\u30d4\u30a2\u4e16\u754c_en.png?t=1747560472\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331090?t=1747560472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331090?t=1747560472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/06691c82a01b896f98995cc3e86864d585310004/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747560472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/06691c82a01b896f98995cc3e86864d585310004/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747560472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Fa